# Engine objects that reference a symbol only a shell object defines, from a
# -fno-lto build. Symbol-level; see tests/linkcheck.sh.
#
# After B7 the zones are directories. What survived the move is search.o
# reaching the option map and the UCI renderers, and timeman.o reaching the
# option map -- the edge the move exposed, since timeman is engine and
# ucioption is shell.
